<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTUGUESE CHAMPIONS SINCE 1934.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTUGUESE CHAMPIONS SINCE 1934.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Porto, champions for the third</p>
<p>successive year, ended the Portuguese league soccer season 13</p>
<p>points ahead of second-placed Sporting following the final</p>
<p>series of matches on Sunday.</p>
<p>Portuguese league champions and runners-up since the</p>
<p>Portuguese league started in 1934:</p>
